## Common Issues and Fixes

- **Layer Violations**: Ensure decisions are on even layers, options on odd
- **Missing Parents**: Every non-root node needs a parent connection
- **Invalid Types**: Check node types match their layer position
- **Broken References**: Ensure all referenced node IDs exist
- **Invalid Enum Values**: Use only the valid enum values listed below

